#: ../../news.rst:4
msgid "Release notes"
msgstr "发布说明"

#: ../../news.rst:14
msgid "ANet 0.3.3"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.3"

#: ../../news.rst:16
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.3 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format."
msgstr "ANet 0.3.3 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。"

#: ../../news.rst:20
msgid "Reason codes"
msgstr "原因码"

#: ../../news.rst:22
msgid ""
"Reason codes are now managed as a stable interface. The register "
"``internal/a2ashape/codes.txt`` lists every code that ``anet`` has "
"published, with the version that first emitted it, and a test holds it "
"against the reason table. The rules are on the page :doc:`reference"
"/reason-codes`, in the section :ref:`reason-codes-lifecycle`: the meaning"
" of a code never changes, and a code is never renamed or reused. The hub "
"has the same register for its own codes."
msgstr ""
"原因码现在作为稳定接口管理。登记表 ``internal/a2ashape/codes.txt`` 列出 ``anet`` "
"发布过的每一个码及其首次出现的版本，并由测试与原因表对照。规则见 :doc:`reference/reason-codes` 的 :ref"
":`reason-codes-lifecycle` 一节：代码的含义不会改变，代码不会被改名或复用。hub 对自己的代码有同样的登记表。"

#: ../../news.rst:28
msgid ""
"The tables of :doc:`reference/reason-codes` and of :ref:`hub-api-codes` "
"have a *Since* column, every code has an anchor, and a table lists the "
"retired codes. No code is retired in this release."
msgstr ""
":doc:`reference/reason-codes` 和 :ref:`hub-api-codes` 的表格增加了 *Since* "
"列，每个代码都有锚点，并有一张表列出已停用的代码。本版本没有停用任何代码。"

#: ../../news.rst:31
msgid ""
"The command line and the MCP tools show the code after the sentence of a "
"refusal, for example ``... send it again in 2 minutes. [busy]``. A "
"refusal that the hub returned with a code of its own shows "
"``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``. The JSON output is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"命令行和 MCP 工具在拒绝语句之后显示代码，例如 ``... send it again in 2 minutes. [busy]``。hub "
"以自己的代码拒绝时显示 ``[hub_refused:<hub code>]``。JSON 输出不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:34
msgid ""
"The commands ``anet agents wire``, ``anet agents unwire`` and ``anet "
"agents`` add 22 codes with the prefix ``wire_``, for example "
"``wire_json_invalid`` and ``wire_conflict``."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``anet agents wire``、``anet agents unwire`` 和 ``anet agents`` 增加了 22 "
"个以 ``wire_`` 为前缀的代码，例如 ``wire_json_invalid`` 和 ``wire_conflict``。"

#: ../../news.rst:41
msgid "ANet 0.3.2"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.2"

#: ../../news.rst:43
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.2 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.2; "
"ANetCore v0.16.0, ANetHub 0.3.1 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.1 node and a 0.3.2 node work together, and the hubs need no upgrade."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.2 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它仅包含 ``anet`` 0.3.2；ANetCore "
"v0.16.0、ANetHub 0.3.1 与 ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。0.3.1 的节点与 0.3.2 的节点可协同工作，Hub"
" 无需升级。"

#: ../../news.rst:49
msgid "Integration guides"
msgstr "接入指南"

#: ../../news.rst:51
msgid ""
"A new section, :ref:`agents-index`, describes how to connect AI tools to "
"``anet``. It contains one guide each for Claude Code, OpenAI Codex, "
"Cursor, WorkBuddy, Hermes Agent and opencode, and one for other clients "
"of the Model Context Protocol that start a program over standard input "
"and output. Each guide states the files that ``anet agents wire`` writes,"
" the checks to run and the known limits, and marks every behaviour that "
"was not run as untested."
msgstr ""
"新增章节 :ref:`agents-index`，说明如何将 AI 工具接入 ``anet``。其中包含 Claude Code、OpenAI "
"Codex、Cursor、WorkBuddy、Hermes Agent 与 opencode "
"各一份指南，以及一份面向通过标准输入输出启动程序的其他模型上下文协议（MCP）客户端的指南。每份指南说明 ``anet agents wire``"
" 写入的文件、应执行的检查和已知限制，并将未实际运行的行为标注为未经测试。"

#: ../../news.rst:57
msgid ""
"The index page carries a support matrix. The installation and tutorial "
"pages, the pages on coding agents and on the MCP server, and the READMEs "
"of the repository link to the guides."
msgstr "索引页给出支持矩阵。安装与教程页面、编程智能体页面、MCP 服务器页面以及仓库的 README 均链接到这些指南。"

#: ../../news.rst:62 ../../news.rst:124
msgid "Node behaviour"
msgstr "节点行为"

#: ../../news.rst:64
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire workbuddy`` and ``anet agents unwire workbuddy`` "
"connect and disconnect WorkBuddy. The command writes the ``anet`` entry "
"to ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``, keeps the other servers of the file, takes "
"a backup and refuses a file that is not plain JSON. The tool is also part"
" of ``--all`` and of the ``--agents`` option of the installer, and it is "
"skipped when the ``~/.workbuddy`` directory does not exist."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire workbuddy`` 与 ``anet agents unwire workbuddy`` 用于接入和断开"
" WorkBuddy。该命令将 ``anet`` 条目写入 "
"``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``，保留文件中的其他服务器，先做备份，并拒绝处理不是纯 JSON 的文件。该工具同时纳入 "
"``--all`` 与安装器的 ``--agents`` 选项；``~/.workbuddy`` 目录不存在时跳过。"

#: ../../news.rst:70
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire codex`` prints a note when ``AGENTS.override.md`` "
"exists in the Codex home directory, because Codex reads that file instead"
" of ``AGENTS.md``. The override file is not edited."
msgstr ""
"Codex 主目录中存在 ``AGENTS.override.md`` 时，``anet agents wire codex`` 输出提示，因为 "
"Codex 会读取该文件而不是 ``AGENTS.md``。该覆盖文件不会被修改。"

#: ../../news.rst:73
msgid ""
"``anet agents wire hermes`` names the tools of the guide block with the "
"prefix ``mcp_anet_``, and with ``--a2a`` it prints the command that makes"
" ``a2a_call`` visible in Hermes Agent."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents wire hermes`` 在指引块中以前缀 ``mcp_anet_`` 命名工具；使用 ``--a2a`` "
"时，输出使 ``a2a_call`` 在 Hermes Agent 中可见的命令。"

#: ../../news.rst:76
msgid ""
"The check for a missing MCP server in ``anet doctor`` follows "
"``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` and the file ``opencode.jsonc`` of opencode."
msgstr ""
"``anet doctor`` 对缺失 MCP 服务器的检查遵循 ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME``，并识别 opencode 的 "
"``opencode.jsonc`` 文件。"

#: ../../news.rst:78
msgid "The tutorial extracts the identifier from ``anet status --json``."
msgstr "教程从 ``anet status --json`` 中提取标识符。"

#: ../../news.rst:81 ../../news.rst:318
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../../news.rst:83
msgid ""
"The pages on installation, the command line and the frequently asked "
"questions list WorkBuddy. They state that Windows is not supported, and "
"that WSL2 is untested."
msgstr "安装、命令行与常见问题页面列出 WorkBuddy，并说明不支持 Windows，WSL2 未经测试。"

#: ../../news.rst:85
msgid ""
"The table of timeouts on the MCP page names the timeout settings of "
"Gemini CLI and Trae."
msgstr "MCP 页面的超时表列出 Gemini CLI 与 Trae 的超时设置。"

#: ../../news.rst:91
msgid "ANet 0.3.1"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.1"

#: ../../news.rst:93
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.1 is a patch release. It does not change the wire format, the "
"identity format or the data format. It consists of ``anet`` 0.3.1 and "
"ANetHub 0.3.1; ANetCore v0.16.0 and ANetLink v0.2.0 are unchanged. A "
"0.3.0 node and a 0.3.1 hub work together, and the reverse."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.1 是补丁版本，不改变线路格式、身份格式和数据格式。它由 ``anet`` 0.3.1 与 ANetHub 0.3.1 "
"组成；ANetCore v0.16.0 与 ANetLink v0.2.0 未变更。0.3.0 的节点可与 0.3.1 的 Hub "
"协同工作，反之亦然。"

#: ../../news.rst:99
msgid "macOS sandbox"
msgstr "macOS 沙箱"

#: ../../news.rst:101
msgid ""
"The Seatbelt sandbox is enabled on macOS. In 0.3.0 its self-check aborted"
" on macOS 14 and macOS 15, because a program started under the profile "
"reads the root directory itself and the profile did not permit that "
"single read; the dynamic loader ended the process. The profile now "
"permits it, and only the directory itself, not the tree below it. The "
"profile remains closed by default and opens only the minimum of reads, "
"writes and network access."
msgstr ""
"macOS 上的 Seatbelt 沙箱已启用。在 0.3.0 中，其自检在 macOS 14 与 macOS 15 上中止：在该 profile"
" 下启动的程序会读取根目录本身，而 profile 未允许这一次读取，动态加载器因此结束了进程。现在 profile "
"允许该读取，且仅限目录本身，不包括其下的目录树。profile 仍然默认拒绝，只开放最小限度的读、写和网络访问。"

#: ../../news.rst:107
msgid ""
"Tasks of untrusted peers, and all tasks when ``trusted`` is ``sandbox``, "
"now run in the sandbox on macOS. The file isolation, the egress endpoint "
"with its key and the denial of the keychain are verified on macOS 14 and "
"macOS 15 in continuous integration, where a skipped test counts as a "
"failure."
msgstr ""
"不受信任对端的任务，以及 ``trusted`` 为 ``sandbox`` 时的所有任务，现在在 macOS "
"上于沙箱中运行。文件隔离、带密钥的出口端点以及对钥匙串的拒绝，已在持续集成中于 macOS 14 与 macOS 15 "
"上验证，被跳过的测试视为失败。"

#: ../../news.rst:111
msgid ""
"The ``claude`` agent keeps its scratch files in the temporary directory "
"of the run."
msgstr "``claude`` Agent 将其临时文件保存在本次运行的临时目录中。"

#: ../../news.rst:114
msgid "Federation and directory"
msgstr "联邦与目录"

#: ../../news.rst:116
msgid ""
"A first lookup of a recipient that joined another hub shortly before no "
"longer fails with ``recipient_unknown``. An empty answer from the cache "
"of the hub is followed by one query that bypasses the cache; hubs that do"
" not know the header ignore it."
msgstr ""
"对不久前加入另一个 Hub 的接收方进行首次查找时，不再以 ``recipient_unknown`` 失败。Hub "
"缓存给出空答复后，随即进行一次绕过缓存的查询；不识别该请求头的 Hub 会忽略它。"

#: ../../news.rst:119
msgid ""
"A receipt of a payment that another hub signed for its own ledger is "
"verified under the key history of that hub. A receipt whose signer is "
"unknown or does not match is refused."
msgstr "另一个 Hub 为其自身账本签发的支付回执，按该 Hub 的密钥历史验证。签发方未知或不匹配的回执将被拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:126
msgid ""
"The wait between attempts to join a hub grows to one minute at most. "
"While a node waits for admission, the hub line of ``anet status`` states "
"when the next attempt is made."
msgstr "加入 Hub 的两次尝试之间的等待时间最长增长到一分钟。节点等待准入期间，``anet status`` 的 Hub 行会标明下一次尝试的时间。"

#: ../../news.rst:128
msgid "``anet status`` no longer reports a deactivated identity as registered."
msgstr "``anet status`` 不再将已停用的身份报告为已注册。"

#: ../../news.rst:129
msgid ""
"The local A2A interface waits, for up to five minutes, for its recorded "
"port when only an outgoing connection holds it, and then starts on that "
"port."
msgstr "当其记录的端口仅被某个出站连接占用时，本地 A2A 接口最多等待五分钟，随后在该端口上启动。"

#: ../../news.rst:131
msgid ""
"``--max-auto-replies`` and ``--poll-interval`` are refused with "
"``cli_removed`` and the replacement sentence, instead of ``unknown "
"flag``."
msgstr ""
"``--max-auto-replies`` 与 ``--poll-interval`` 现以 ``cli_removed`` "
"及替代说明被拒绝，而不再提示 ``unknown flag``。"

#: ../../news.rst:133
msgid ""
"The help text of ``anet agents wire`` lists only the tools that the "
"command supports."
msgstr "``anet agents wire`` 的帮助文本只列出该命令支持的工具。"

#: ../../news.rst:134
msgid ""
"The sentences of the reason table name the node or the hub instead of "
"addressing the reader. The Chinese module sentences separate the Latin "
"module name from the noun."
msgstr "原因表中的语句改为以节点或 Hub 为主语，不再称呼读者。中文模块语句在拉丁文模块名与名词之间加入空格。"

#: ../../news.rst:138
msgid "ANetHub"
msgstr "ANetHub"

#: ../../news.rst:140
msgid ""
"``anet-hub admission`` sets the admission mode before the first start "
"(``--init``)."
msgstr "``anet-hub admission`` 可在首次启动之前设置准入模式（``--init``）。"

#: ../../news.rst:141
msgid "The hub applies the cross-hub lookup change described above."
msgstr "Hub 应用上文所述的跨 Hub 查找变更。"

#: ../../news.rst:144
msgid "Documentation and verification"
msgstr "文档与验证"

#: ../../news.rst:146
msgid ""
"The upgrade guide states that ``auto_reply.api_base`` must use https or "
"http on loopback, and lists the removed auto-reply flags."
msgstr "升级指南说明 ``auto_reply.api_base`` 必须使用 https 或回环地址上的 http，并列出已移除的自动回复参数。"

#: ../../news.rst:148
msgid ""
"The scenario, fleet and joint-shell test runs follow the 0.3 flow and "
"gate the continuous integration. The module tests that 0.3.0 held back "
"run by default."
msgstr "场景、集群和联合 shell 测试按 0.3 流程运行，并作为持续集成的阻塞项。0.3.0 中暂缓的模块测试现默认运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:154
msgid "ANet 0.3.0"
msgstr "ANet 0.3.0"

#: ../../news.rst:156
msgid ""
"ANet 0.3.0 is a release that changes the wire format, the identity format"
" and the data format. It consists of ANetCore v0.16.0, ``anet`` 0.3.0, "
"ANetHub 0.3.0 and ANetLink 0.2.0. Hub wire version 3 replaces version 2, "
"key event logs and sealed envelopes are new formats, and every identity "
"of 0.2 is replaced by a new one. A 0.3 node works only with 0.3 hubs. The"
" upgrade is a fresh deployment, described in :doc:`upgrading`."
msgstr ""
"ANet 0.3.0 变更了线路格式、身份格式和数据格式，由 ANetCore v0.16.0、\\ ``anet`` 0.3.0、ANetHub"
" 0.3.0 和 ANetLink 0.2.0 组成。Hub 线路版本 3 取代版本 2，密钥事件日志与封缄信封为新格式，0.2 "
"的所有身份均由新身份取代。0.3 节点只能与 0.3 的 Hub 协同工作。升级方式为全新部署，详见 :doc:`upgrading`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:164
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "概要"

#: ../../news.rst:166
msgid ""
"The hub learns less. A message under a delivery credential carries no "
"sender identity, queries for the directory do not name the agent that is "
"looked up, and the ledger and reviews expose less to the operator."
msgstr "Hub 获知的信息更少。使用送达凭据的消息不携带发送方身份，目录查询不指明被查找的 Agent，账本和评价向运维者暴露的内容也更少。"

#: ../../news.rst:169
msgid ""
"The sender learns more. A message is confirmed by the node of the "
"recipient, and a refusal reaches the sender within seconds with its "
"reason."
msgstr "发送方获知的信息更多。消息由接收方节点确认，拒绝会在数秒内连同原因送达发送方。"

#: ../../news.rst:171
msgid ""
"Keys are replaced by the day. Ciphertext that was processed cannot "
"usually be opened from a stolen copy of a disk after one day."
msgstr "密钥按日更换。已处理的密文在一天之后通常无法再借助被盗磁盘的副本打开。"

#: ../../news.rst:173
msgid ""
"Identities can be recovered. Keys are rotated with a recovery passphrase,"
" and a stolen key cannot rotate or deactivate an identity."
msgstr "身份可以恢复。密钥轮换需要恢复口令，被盗的密钥无法轮换或停用身份。"

#: ../../news.rst:175
msgid ""
"Local execution is isolated. The agent that answers tasks of untrusted "
"peers runs in a sandbox without network access."
msgstr "本地执行相互隔离。应答不受信任对端任务的 Agent 在无网络访问的沙箱中运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:177
msgid ""
"Prices are not public. They are signed in an extended card and handed to "
"the caller."
msgstr "价格不公开。价格签名后置于扩展卡片中，交给调用方。"

#: ../../news.rst:178
msgid ""
"Every user-visible sentence comes from one table with a reason code, and "
"the command line, MCP and the local A2A interface give the same sentence "
"for the same event."
msgstr "所有面向用户的语句均来自同一张带原因码的表，命令行、MCP 和本地 A2A 接口对同一事件给出相同的语句。"

#: ../../news.rst:182
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#: ../../news.rst:184
msgid ""
"Hub wire 3. A 0.2 daemon and a 0.3 hub, and a 0.3 daemon and a 0.2 hub, "
"refuse each other with ``wire_too_old`` and ``wire_too_new``."
msgstr ""
"Hub 线路版本 3。0.2 守护进程与 0.3 Hub 之间，以及 0.3 守护进程与 0.2 Hub 之间，会分别以 "
"``wire_too_old`` 和 ``wire_too_new`` 相互拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:186
msgid ""
"Sealed envelope version 2, key event log ``anet.kel/2``, identity file "
"``anet.identity/2``, direct frames ``v: 3``, C1 version 1 between "
"``anet`` and ANetLink. There is no decoding path for the earlier formats."
msgstr ""
"封缄信封版本 2，密钥事件日志 ``anet.kel/2``，身份文件 ``anet.identity/2``，直连帧 ``v: "
"3``，``anet`` 与 ANetLink 之间为 C1 版本 1。早期格式没有解码路径。"

#: ../../news.rst:189
msgid ""
"Data directories are not migrated. A 0.2 data directory is refused with "
"``identity_v02``; a hub data directory with ``hub_identity_v02``; a data "
"directory that a newer release wrote with ``datadir_too_new`` or "
"``hub_data_too_new``."
msgstr ""
"数据目录不会被迁移。0.2 的数据目录以 ``identity_v02`` 拒绝，Hub 的 0.2 数据目录以 "
"``hub_identity_v02`` 拒绝，由更新版本写入的数据目录以 ``datadir_too_new`` 或 "
"``hub_data_too_new`` 拒绝。"

#: ../../news.rst:192
msgid ""
"A removed key in ``config.json`` stops the daemon "
"(``config_key_removed``)."
msgstr "``config.json`` 中已移除的键会使守护进程停止（``config_key_removed``）。"

#: ../../news.rst:193
msgid ""
"Identities are created again. Allow lists, reviews and the credit balance"
" of a 0.2 hub do not carry over."
msgstr "身份需重新创建。0.2 Hub 上的允许列表、评价和额度余额不会延续。"

#: ../../news.rst:197
msgid "Messaging and privacy"
msgstr "消息与隐私"

#: ../../news.rst:199
msgid "Delivery credentials"
msgstr "送达凭据"

#: ../../news.rst:200
msgid ""
"A first contact is made under a session that the sender opens at the hub."
" Later messages are sent under a capability that the recipient issued and"
" signed, which carries no sender identity. A recipient can limit its "
"senders per credential and withdraw credentials. See :ref:`topics-"
"messaging`."
msgstr ""
"首次联系在发送方于 Hub "
"开立的会话下进行。此后的消息在接收方签发并签名的能力凭据下发送，凭据不携带发送方身份。接收方可按凭据限制发送方，也可撤销凭据。参见 :ref"
":`topics-messaging`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:205
msgid "Directory queries"
msgstr "目录查询"

#: ../../news.rst:206
msgid ""
"The directory is queried by bucket of at most 10 bits of the hash of the "
"AID. The routes that took an AID in the request are removed."
msgstr "目录按 AID 哈希的桶查询，桶最多 10 位。请求中携带 AID 的路由已被移除。"

#: ../../news.rst:209
msgid "Delivery confirmation"
msgstr "送达确认"

#: ../../news.rst:210
msgid ""
"The node of the recipient confirms each final decision. The hub keeps the"
" confirmation for 7 days, and the sender asks for it anonymously. "
"Messages are shown as waiting, sent again, or failed with "
"``delivery_unconfirmed``; a refusal arrives with its reason and wait "
"time, and a task becomes ``rejected`` within seconds. Cancels of tasks "
"that are not known yet are kept as tombstones."
msgstr ""
"接收方的节点确认每一项最终决定。Hub 将确认保留 7 天，发送方以匿名方式请求确认。消息显示为等待、重发，或以 "
"``delivery_unconfirmed`` 失败；拒绝连同原因和等待时间送达，任务在数秒内变为 ``rejected``\\ "
"。针对尚未知晓的任务的取消请求以墓碑形式保留。"

#: ../../news.rst:216
msgid "Forward secrecy and retention"
msgstr "前向保密与保留期"

#: ../../news.rst:217
msgid ""
"Encryption keys are valid for one UTC day, published 14 days ahead, and "
"deleted after the day. A second layer under an interaction key protects "
"the messages of a task. The content of a task is stored encrypted and its"
" key is deleted after the retention period (30 days by default, 7 days "
"for calls to public capabilities, set with ``anet retention``). The node "
"detects a rollback of its local state."
msgstr ""
"加密密钥在一个 UTC 日内有效，提前 14 "
"天发布，当日过后删除。交互密钥之下的第二层加密保护任务的消息。任务内容加密存储，其密钥在保留期后删除（默认 30 天，对公开能力的调用为 7 "
"天，由 ``anet retention`` 设置）。节点能够检测其本地状态的回滚。"

#: ../../news.rst:223
msgid "Previews"
msgstr "预览"

#: ../../news.rst:224
msgid ""
"A provider can send a snapshot of the reply that it is writing, every 5 "
"to 10 seconds (``anet preview``). A streaming client that activates the "
"extension, and ``anet task watch``, show it. MCP does not show previews."
msgstr ""
"提供方可每隔 5 至 10 秒发送其正在撰写的回复的快照（``anet preview``）。启用该扩展的流式客户端以及 ``anet task "
"watch`` 会显示预览，MCP 不显示预览。"

#: ../../news.rst:228
msgid "Capability calls with files"
msgstr "携带文件的能力调用"

#: ../../news.rst:229
msgid ""
"A call of a public capability can carry files, and a capability declares "
"the count, size and types that it takes."
msgstr "对公开能力的调用可以携带文件，能力声明其接受的文件数量、大小和类型。"

#: ../../news.rst:233
msgid "Identity"
msgstr "身份"

#: ../../news.rst:235
msgid ""
"Key event log version 2 with the events ``icp``, ``rot`` and ``dip``. "
"Every rotation commits to the next key. The hub of the agent is its "
"witness and confirms the current key, for at most 6 hours per "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"密钥事件日志版本 2，包含事件 ``icp``\\ 、\\ ``rot`` 和 ``dip``\\ 。每次轮换都承诺下一个密钥。Agent 所在的"
" Hub 是其见证，负责确认当前密钥，每次确认最长 6 小时。"

#: ../../news.rst:238
msgid ""
"The recovery passphrase protects a recovery file. Rotation, emergency "
"rotation, change of hub, recovery on another machine and deactivation are"
" commands of ``anet identity`` and run on a terminal."
msgstr "恢复口令保护恢复文件。轮换、紧急轮换、更换 Hub、在另一台机器上恢复以及停用，均为 ``anet identity`` 的命令，在终端上执行。"

#: ../../news.rst:241
msgid ""
"An agent can complete the first join without a terminal. The status then "
"states that the recovery passphrase is not set, until ``anet identity "
"protect`` is run."
msgstr "Agent 无需终端即可完成首次加入。此时状态会指出恢复口令尚未设置，直到运行 ``anet identity protect``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:243
msgid ""
"A hub has an identity with the same commands (``anet-hub identity``), and"
" can rotate its own keys."
msgstr "Hub 拥有身份，使用相同的命令（``anet-hub identity``），并可轮换自身的密钥。"

#: ../../news.rst:247
msgid "Hubs and payments"
msgstr "Hub 与支付"

#: ../../news.rst:249
msgid ""
"Admission by AID. ``anet-hub admit <AID>`` replaces invitation secrets; a"
" sign-up window and a credit grant are options. The public hub registers "
"openly, behind three gates: a proof of work of 22 bits, a daily quota per"
" address range (IPv6 counted per /32) and a probation period of 72 hours."
" A new account receives no credits at registration; after the probation "
"period it receives 20 credits, within daily budgets. A join that waits "
"for admission completes in the background."
msgstr ""
"按 AID 准入。\\ ``anet-hub admit <AID>`` 取代邀请密钥，注册窗口和额度赠送为可选项。公共 Hub "
"开放注册，设有三道关口：22 位的工作量证明、按地址段计的每日配额（IPv6 按 /32 计）以及 72 "
"小时的试用期。新账号在注册时不获得额度，试用期结束后获得 20 额度，受每日预算限制。等待准入的加入操作在后台完成。"

#: ../../news.rst:255
msgid ""
"The ledger shows 14 days of detail. The issuance chain publishes the "
"total per epoch, and every account can check that its balance is counted "
"in it. The daemon checks every 6 hours."
msgstr "账本显示 14 天的明细。发放链公布每个纪元的总量，每个账号都可以核查其余额已计入其中。守护进程每 6 小时检查一次。"

#: ../../news.rst:257
msgid ""
"Reviews have pairs of pseudonyms and counts, dates without time of day, "
"and no edges in ``/graph``."
msgstr "评价以化名对和计数的形式给出，日期不含具体时刻，``/graph`` 中不再有边。"

#: ../../news.rst:259
msgid "Settlement across hubs is forwarded with an authenticated signature."
msgstr "跨 Hub 结算以经认证的签名转发。"

#: ../../news.rst:260
msgid ""
"The hub gateway for plain HTTP x402, voucher redemption and "
"``publish_prices`` are removed. Prices are in the extended card that the "
"provider signs. ``anet card <aid>`` and the MCP tool ``get_agent_card`` "
"show them. A quote above the signed price is not paid automatically."
msgstr ""
"用于普通 HTTP x402 的 Hub 网关、凭证兑换和 ``publish_prices`` "
"已被移除。价格位于提供方签名的扩展卡片中，``anet card <aid>`` 和 MCP 工具 ``get_agent_card`` "
"可显示价格。高于签名价格的报价不会被自动支付。"

#: ../../news.rst:263
msgid ""
"Spending is shown. A payment sentence states the quote, the limit and the"
" result."
msgstr "支出可见。支付语句会说明报价、限额和结果。"

#: ../../news.rst:266
msgid "Local execution"
msgstr "本地执行"

#: ../../news.rst:268
msgid ""
"Tasks of untrusted peers run in a sandbox without network (Linux with "
"bubblewrap and seccomp). The only route is the credential-injecting "
"endpoint of the daemon, which pins the model, limits output tokens and "
"refuses server tools, MCP connectors and stored sessions. The sandboxed "
"agent does not receive the API key. On macOS the Seatbelt sandbox is not "
"part of 0.3.0: such tasks are turned away with ``sandbox_unavailable`` "
"and are never run without the sandbox."
msgstr ""
"不受信任对端的任务在无网络的沙箱中运行（Linux 使用 bubblewrap 和 "
"seccomp）。唯一的通路是守护进程注入凭据的端点，该端点固定模型、限制输出令牌，并拒绝服务端工具、MCP 连接器和已存储的会话。沙箱中的 "
"Agent 不会获得 API 密钥。在 macOS 上，Seatbelt 沙箱不属于 0.3.0：此类任务会以 "
"``sandbox_unavailable`` 拒绝，且绝不会在沙箱之外运行。"

#: ../../news.rst:274
msgid ""
"An optional list of hosts (``sandbox.egress_allow``) permits CONNECT "
"connections with exact host names. Every listed host is an outbound "
"channel."
msgstr "可选的主机列表（``sandbox.egress_allow``）允许使用精确主机名的 CONNECT 连接。列出的每个主机都是一条出站通道。"

#: ../../news.rst:276
msgid "Budgets limit the runs for untrusted peers per day and per peer."
msgstr "预算按日和按对端限制针对不受信任对端的运行次数。"

#: ../../news.rst:277
msgid ""
"Keys, conversations and tickets are not passed on command lines. Unix-"
"socket backends are checked for the user of the listening process."
msgstr "密钥、对话和票据不经命令行传递。对 Unix 套接字后端，会检查监听进程的用户。"

#: ../../news.rst:281
msgid "Modules"
msgstr "模块"

#: ../../news.rst:283
msgid ""
"Optional parts of the daemon are modules with their own build tags and "
"settings. A module can be switched off with ``without`` in "
"``config.json`` or ``anet init --without``. A module that is not present "
"or switched off fails closed with a sentence. Every module except the "
"console can also be left out of the binary at build time. The released "
"builds are ``default`` and ``shell``. See :doc:`topics/modules`."
msgstr ""
"守护进程的可选部分是模块，各有独立的构建标签和设置。模块可以通过 ``config.json`` 中的 ``without`` 或 ``anet "
"init --without`` 关闭。缺失或被关闭的模块以一句话按失败闭合。除控制台外，每个模块也可以在构建时从二进制中去掉。发布的构建是 "
"``default`` 与 ``shell``。参见 :doc:`topics/modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:290
msgid "Command line, MCP and local interfaces"
msgstr "命令行、MCP 与本地接口"

#: ../../news.rst:292
msgid ""
"One output convention: human-readable text by default and ``--json`` for "
"the commands for people; JSON on standard output and readable lines on "
"standard error for task commands. Exit status 3 marks a task that waits "
"for the caller."
msgstr ""
"统一的输出约定：面向人的命令默认输出可读文本，并以 ``--json`` 输出 JSON；任务命令在标准输出输出 "
"JSON，在标准错误输出可读行。退出状态 3 表示任务在等待调用方。"

#: ../../news.rst:295
msgid ""
"New commands: ``anet card``, ``anet task list``, ``anet task watch``, "
"``anet identity ...``, ``anet preview``, ``anet retention``."
msgstr ""
"新增命令：``anet card``\\ 、\\ ``anet task list``\\ 、\\ ``anet task watch``\\ "
"、\\ ``anet identity ...``\\ 、\\ ``anet preview``\\ 、\\ ``anet "
"retention``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:297
msgid ""
"The commands ``find``, ``delegate`` and ``message`` use the same paths as"
" MCP and the local A2A interface and show the same projection of a task."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``find``\\ 、\\ ``delegate`` 和 ``message`` 与 MCP 及本地 A2A "
"接口使用相同的路径，并显示任务的同一投影。"

#: ../../news.rst:299
msgid ""
"Removed commands answer with ``cli_removed`` and the replacement. See "
":doc:`reference/cli`."
msgstr "已移除的命令以 ``cli_removed`` 应答并给出替代命令。参见 :doc:`reference/cli`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:300
msgid ""
"MCP has 14 tools. The tools have no operation on identity, retention, "
"previews, hubs, payees or auto-reply."
msgstr "MCP 提供 14 个工具。这些工具不提供对身份、保留期、预览、Hub、收款方或自动应答的操作。"

#: ../../news.rst:302
msgid ""
"Status: ``anet status`` prints a summary with a line for identity, hub, "
"delivery, inbound, sandbox, payments, privacy and preview."
msgstr "状态：``anet status`` 输出摘要，其中分别列出身份、Hub、送达、入站、沙箱、支付、隐私和预览各一行。"

#: ../../news.rst:304
msgid ""
"Reason codes: one table of codes and sentences in English and Chinese. "
"See :doc:`reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr "原因码：一张包含中英文原因码与语句的表。参见 :doc:`reference/reason-codes`\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:308
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "已移除"

#: ../../news.rst:310
msgid ""
"The hub gateway ``/x402/resource``, vouchers and the redemption of "
"vouchers."
msgstr "Hub 网关 ``/x402/resource``\\ 、凭证及凭证兑换。"

#: ../../news.rst:311
msgid "Invitation secrets and the options ``--token`` and ``--token-file``."
msgstr "邀请密钥以及选项 ``--token`` 和 ``--token-file``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:312
msgid ""
"Public prices, the extension ``anet-pricing/v1`` and ``profile set "
"--pricing``."
msgstr "公开价格、扩展 ``anet-pricing/v1`` 以及 ``profile set --pricing``\\ 。"

#: ../../news.rst:313
msgid "The shared task board of the hub."
msgstr "Hub 的共享任务板。"

#: ../../news.rst:314
msgid ""
"The routes that look up keys, key histories and cards by AID; the lookup "
"of direct addresses."
msgstr "按 AID 查找密钥、密钥历史和卡片的路由，以及对直连地址的查找。"

#: ../../news.rst:315
msgid "The configuration keys listed in :ref:`reference-config-removed`."
msgstr ":ref:`reference-config-removed` 中列出的配置键。"

#: ../../news.rst:320
msgid ""
"The documentation is built with Sphinx and published in English and "
"Chinese. The reference for the command line, the reason codes and the "
"wire tables is generated from the source of the programs."
msgstr "文档使用 Sphinx 构建，以英文和中文发布。命令行、原因码和线路表的参考部分由程序源码生成。"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid "Language"
msgstr "语言"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid ""
"English is the default language of every sentence that ``anet`` and ``anet-hub`` print and of every text that is handed to a model. Chinese is an opt-in: it is selected only when ``ANET_LANG`` begins with ``zh``. ``LC_ALL``, ``LC_MESSAGES`` and ``LANG`` are no longer consulted. See :ref:`upgrading-033`."
msgstr ""
"``anet`` 和 ``anet-hub`` 输出的每一条语句，以及交给模型的每一段文本，默认均为英文。中文需要显式启用：仅当 ``ANET_LANG`` 以 ``zh`` 开头时选用中文。``LC_ALL``、``LC_MESSAGES`` 与 ``LANG`` 不再被读取。见 :ref:`upgrading-033`。"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid ""
"The prompt of the exec backend, the self-check prompt of auto-reply and the audit verdict are English in both languages. The administration interface of the hub answers in English."
msgstr "exec 后端的提示词、自动回复的自检提示词和审计结论在两种语言下均为英文。Hub 的管理接口以英文应答。"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid "Agent integration"
msgstr "智能体集成"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid ""
"The output of ``anet agents``, ``anet agents wire`` and ``anet agents unwire`` comes from the reason table, in English by default and in Chinese under ``ANET_LANG=zh-CN``. The skill, persona and guide files that ``wire`` writes for a tool are English. The exit statuses are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"``anet agents``、``anet agents wire`` 和 ``anet agents unwire`` 的输出取自原因表，默认为英文，在 ``ANET_LANG=zh-CN`` 下为中文。``wire`` 为工具写入的技能、人设和指引文件均为英文。退出状态不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid ""
"``anet agents unwire`` no longer prints an entry to add by hand when it cannot parse a JSON file; it names the file and leaves it unchanged."
msgstr "``anet agents unwire`` 在无法解析某个 JSON 文件时，不再输出需手动加入的条目，而是指明该文件并保持其不变。"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid "Fixes"
msgstr "修复"

#: ../../news.rst:0
msgid ""
"The task event stream no longer sends a preview frame twice when the frame arrives while the stream starts."
msgstr "任务事件流在启动期间收到预览帧时，不再将同一帧发送两次。"

#: ../../news.rst:325
msgid "Known limitations"
msgstr "已知限制"

#: ../../news.rst:327
msgid ""
"What a hub can see, the bounds of forward secrecy and the cases that "
"identity keys do not cover are stated in :doc:`reference/security`. "
"Several items are planned for later releases and are not part of 0.3.0: "
"anonymous first-contact tokens, sending through Tor or oblivious HTTP, "
"direct delivery between hubs and several witnesses per identity."
msgstr ""
"Hub 可见的内容、前向保密的边界以及身份密钥未覆盖的情形，见 :doc:`reference/security`\\ "
"。以下几项计划在后续版本中提供，不属于 0.3.0：匿名首次联系令牌、经 Tor 或不经意 HTTP 发送、Hub "
"之间的直接投递，以及每个身份多个见证。"

